   "headline": "KOSPI drops 3.31% on AI worries to its lowest close since January",
   "when": "Mon 23 Nov · Seoul close",
   "what": "The KOSPI closed at 4,708.54 after a five-minute trading halt when it was down about 5%. Decliners beat gainers 823 to 69. Foreign investors turned net sellers of 366.9 billion won. Samsung Electronics fell 3.06% to 177,500 won and SK hynix 2.52% to 1.09 million won. The won weakened to 1,345.9 per dollar. SK hynix's US shares then rose 20% on Monday.",
